BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:Tunes on Tap-1792537200
SUMMARY:Tunes on Tap
DTSTAMP:20261010T113912Z
DTSTART:20261021T000000Z
DTEND:20261021T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:How has it been\, a week\, since this glorious\, Tunes on Tap e
	vening\, already?! \n\nThe one where My Tiny Hand\, met Piss Crystals\, me
	t Rebecca 😁\n\nWe love being graced\, with talented local musicians\, any 
	musicians\, to be fair\, as it’s always\, a cracking time\, when music and
	 people\, are joined together\n\nTunes on Tap\, is every third Wednesday\,
	 each month\, so keep up to date\, on our socials\, as to who will be join
	ing us\, on the 21st of October! \n\nFor now\, come and join us\, from 3pm
	 - 11pm (daily) for everything from board games to retro games consoles\, 
	plenty of art materials\, or have a chat\, bring your mates\, or bring a b
	ook\, and have a relaxing time\, in your local living room\n\nSee you soon
	!\n\nLovely Sue (photos by me 😁)\n\n___________________\nNewland Tap\n135 
	Newland Avenue\nOpen 3pm - 11pm daily\nBYO food \nDrink our drinks\nDogs w
	orshipped 🐾 \n\n #🐾\n#newlandavenue \n#newlandavenuehull \n#lovedogs \n#su
	pportlocalbusinesses
URL:https://www.instagram.com/p/DdoTzfUiAPT/
LOCATION:Newland Tap
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
